const linesFor = (o: string): Ln[] => (o === "levels" ? [...klLines, ...kimLines, ...necks] : o === "kyle" ? V.levels.kyle.map((l: any) => ({ ...l, color: c.amb, dash: l.px === 83104 || l.px === 83484, op: 0.75, sw: 1.1 })) : o === "fib" ? fibLines : o === "anchors" ? V.levels.anchors.map((l: any) => ({ ...l, color: c.t2, op: 0.7, sw: 1 })) : []);
